      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mono_Hot_Springs"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Six hot springs rise here, the hottest reaching 112 °F (44.4 °C), located on a hillside across the South Fork of the San Joaquin River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
