      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mono_Hot_Springs"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mono Hot Springs sits at 6,562 ft (2,000 m) in the central Sierra Nevada, overlooking Florence Lake and Lake Thomas A. Edison reservoirs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
